Version: 0.0.8.9003
Date: 2026-09-28
R: 4.4.3
Studies: variance_draws, df_tables
Date.df_tables: 2026-09-28
Date.variance_draws: 2026-09-28
Note: Arm B of item 78, pre-registered in studies/scripts/variance_draws.R
 (header ce21f68). The main run (100 replicates per cell, 7,600 fits) and
 the fresh-seed run (50 per cell, 3,800 fits, seeds offset by 1,000,000)
 ran from the script at 8867741 (main) and 8867741 then c32ca22 (fresh; a
 scheduling change, jobs handed out one at a time), on illume built from
 hold-pass 89b4b52 (tree 486e3e97838c905304588c90155573dd9b853a9d), in a
 pinned library whose manifest did not change over either run. Both were
 checkpointed per fit and resumed several times on more or fewer workers;
 every fit sets its own seed, and a resumed run was shown to give the same
 numbers as an uninterrupted one. The main run took 41 core-hours against
 the design's 17 (B2's profiles, and the profiles' second start added in
 the smoke run).
Note: Changes after the pre-registration, before any main-run data: the
 profiles' second start, linear interpolation of the profile, the estimate
 added to the draws' grid (bcf726d), and the exploratory lower-plateau
 measure (eeae392, ba644fd). After the runs, reporting fixes to the
 summariser only (01d5b66): no fit was rerun and no per-fit number changed.
Note: One fit of 7,600 failed (cell 28, rep 9: a 12-point gaussian AR(1)
 series, nlminb stopping on an NA/NaN gradient); none of the fresh run's.
Note: The df tables study (D-DF1 to D-DF5), pre-registered in
 studies/scripts/df_tables.R (6eeeec7; code c0f3db5, the verdict relabelled
 for reading after the main run, no number changed). The main run (1,000
 replicates per cell, 24,000 fits) and the fresh-seed run (500 per cell,
 12,000 fits, seeds offset by 1,000,000) ran on illume acf93c2 in a pinned
 library (17 packages) whose manifest did not change over either run, on 2
 workers. The fresh run's final bind failed after every fit was
 checkpointed (its script was edited while it ran); run again, it read all
 12,000 from the checkpoints and refitted none. Per-cell summaries and the
 verdicts are filed here; the per-fit tables stay on local disk.
